      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently this is a Unity bug and can not be fixed by vrchat right now according to them. A temp fix is to disable every device in the sound manager except the one you want which should force vrchat to change to that default device. Or you can pass everything through a virtual cable or similar so that if it does break it wont change devices in game. Otherwise you will need to restart at this point.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
