  "details": "I noticed VRChat ist one of the only games that are not able to re-connect my microphone after steam re-connects my HMD. Please make this possible. I have only one active mic driver and it still doesn't re-connect it. Especially people who use wireless headsets (HTC Vive wireless, TPCast) will run out of battery or simply crash in a game where they have to unplug and re-plug the headset. This happens a lot to me in VRChat and I completely lose the ability to talk with people immediately when it happens.",
